<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Towards Distributed Neural Architectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Breaking Transformer Blocks</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A6.SS1" title="In Appendix F Breaking Transformer Blocks ‣ Towards Distributed Neural Architectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F.1 </span>Vision DNA</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A6.SS2" title="In Appendix F Breaking Transformer Blocks ‣ Towards Distributed Neural Architectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F.2 </span>Language DNA</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
