<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 28: </span>Tokens that go through different rank paths/ribbons. <span id="A6.F28.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Left</span>: top-<math id="A6.F28.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math> model; <span id="A6.F28.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Right</span>: top-<math id="A6.F28.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2</annotation></semantics></math> model.</figcaption>
</figure>
